lete semantic question asking for studies that quantify these specific metabolites in paired human samples and correlate them with ICI outcomes.\n        *   `Which clinical studies quantify absolute concentrations of inosine and short-chain fatty acids in paired human tumor tissues and serum using targeted metabolomics, and report their correlation with immune checkpoint inhibitor response rates or survival outcomes?`\n\n3.  **Check Constraints:**\n    *   *At most 2 queries?* Yes.\n    *   *Keyword format:* subject/material + specific relationship? Yes.\n    *   *Question format:* complete semantic statement with subject, relationship, setting? Yes.\n    *   *No gap description pasted?* Checked.\n    *   *No repetition of previous directions?* Previous were broad keyword searches. These are method-specific and explicitly ask for quantification",
